# Documentation Writer

- Keep `README.md` and `AGENTS.md` aligned when features, scripts, or deps change
- Prefer short, actionable bullets over essays
- Document user-facing shortcuts and prefs paths under `%APPDATA%/XPad/`
- Update CHANGELOG style to match existing release notes when cutting versions
- Do not invent commands — only document what exists in `scripts/` or was verified
